    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "**三、测定玻璃的折射率**"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "**仪器和材料：**"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "带底座的小灯，蓄电池组，开关，两侧是平行平面的玻璃板，带狭缝的屏，三角板，量角器，白纸，导线。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "**实验步骤：**"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "1. 通过开关连接灯和电池组组成电路。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "2. 在灯的前面放置带狭缝的屏，在屏后放置一张白纸。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "3. 闭合电路后在纸上获得光的明亮的细条纹(光线)。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "4. 把玻璃板横放在光路上。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "5. 在纸上用铅笔沿着折射面画线，并标出入射线的始点$A$ 和终点 $B$，及光线由玻璃平板射出的点 $C$(图 $278$)。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "6. 切断电路，取下玻璃板。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "7. 作入射线和折射线，并在入射点上作玻璃板的垂直线。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "8. 用量角器测量出入射角 $\\alpha$和折射角 $\\beta$。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "9. 根据公式计算折射率$n=\\frac{\\sin\\alpha}{\\sin\\beta}$"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "10. 在由其他角度入射时重复实验并比较结果。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "图 $278$"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "**III. Determine the refractive index of glass**"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "**Apparatus and materials:**"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "A small lamp on a base, a battery pack, a switch, a glass plate with parallel plane faces, a screen with a slit, a set square, a protractor, white paper, and connecting wires."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "**Procedure:**"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "1. Connect the lamp and battery pack through the switch to form a circuit."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "2. Place the screen with a slit in front of the lamp, and place a sheet of white paper behind the screen."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "3. Close the circuit to produce a narrow, bright strip of light on the paper (a light ray)."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "4. Place the glass plate across the path of the light."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "5. Use a pencil to draw a line along the refracting face on the paper. Mark the start $A$ and end $B$ of the incident ray, and the point $C$ where the ray leaves the glass plate (Figure $278$)."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "6. Open the circuit and remove the glass plate."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "7. Draw the incident and refracted rays. At the point of incidence, draw a line perpendicular to the face of the glass plate."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "8. Measure the angle of incidence $\\alpha$ and the angle of refraction $\\beta$ with the protractor."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "9. Calculate the refractive index using the formula.\n$n=\\frac{\\sin\\alpha}{\\sin\\beta}$"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "10. Repeat the experiment with other angles of incidence and compare the results."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c4-s4",
        "text": "Figure $278$"
      }
    ],
